# evidence-for: US-008, FR-024, FR-025, FR-026, AC-032, AC-033, AC-034
#
# US-008. The three rule changes, each with the half that must not move beside it.
#
# FR-024 / AC-032: the four verbs surface as weak-verb at medium and exit 0;
# supercharge is still marketing-buzzword at high and still exits 1, so the
# demotion did not take the rest of the high list with it.
#
# FR-025 / AC-033: a human Co-Authored-By trailer passes and the same trailer
# naming Claude is agent-attribution at high. The rule was not deleted to fix the
# false positive.
#
# FR-026 / AC-034: the four text-presentation and non-emoji marks in headings
# produce nothing, and the three Emoji_Presentation=Yes characters each produce
# an emoji-heading. Per emoji-data.txt 16.0, U+2713 and U+279C carry no Emoji
# property at all and U+2714 and U+2B06 are text-presentation.
